{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"8da860d94b4173a42193f191a04cd70642c3d6ec754d04abb95914e0c6c8534a","ja":"カラオケ対決の勝者は……！","zh":"卡拉OK对决的胜者是……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"81a39c0f54304bce3f97981a2c3564f3898d6ea6503b528f60a827a6422fa771","ja":"「素晴らしい歌声をありがとうございました！\nそれでは、ラスト……松田亜利沙さん、どうぞ！」","zh":"「感谢您带来的精彩歌声！\n那么，最后……松田亚利沙小姐，请吧！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"bdd688e12211ebc1a41470d4575617527656ac79e37e595021ed571d8a8f981e","ja":"みなさん！　お待たせいたしました～！　ありさ特製、\nアイドルちゃんへのラブがもりもりアレンジです！","zh":"大家！让你们久等啦～！这是亚利沙特制的，\n满载对偶像们的爱的改编版！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"7d710bdba1b8a274aa7c0cb02e132529a58a4b97e3633ff6fb7b6f276349dd40","ja":"歌い方はスタンダードだけど……なんか、歌詞に\r\nちょいちょいアイドルの名前がねじ込まれてないか？","zh":"唱法是标准的……不过，歌词里\n好像不时地塞进了偶像的名字吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"baf6f688fae23e7592aebcebed2527830155ac3bc763a74514fa49064e8858ed","ja":"コールアンドレスポンスだけじゃなくて、\nオタ芸も入れて、もりだくさんね！","zh":"不光有互动应援，\n还加入了宅艺，内容真丰富呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1954289baf80f8eebae8c943379be87060a66ce285d92313caf91b29fa4af273","ja":"すっごく亜利沙ちゃんらしくて、面白いよ～！\nA・RI・SA！　A・RI・SA！　Fu～！","zh":"特别有亚利沙的风格，真有意思～！\nA・RI・SA！　A・RI・SA！　Fu～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"ae1a508ffe67f770b461f9a72db05ee2b3619b1f718800214042d64a63383639","ja":"「それでは結果発表です！\n審査の結果、優勝は……所恵美さんです！」","zh":"「接下来公布结果！\n经评审，冠军是……所惠美小姐！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"a3a08a273fa7cfb9f9ec16634171fa2cd68da57724a71f07d923b98c34454a64","ja":"えっ、うそ……アタシが一番！？　どうして？\r\nみんなのパフォーマンス、すごかったのに！","zh":"诶，骗人……我拿第一！？为什么？\n明明大家的表演都很精彩啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"ec4a4b4ab2a6b170f6fdcfe37ccd6a8e3e5adb20e90d081fd6027c1c465a6dfa","ja":"「今回の企画に一番合っていたことと、観客も\n巻き込んで歌うパフォーマンスが評価されました！」","zh":"「最符合本次企划这一点，\n以及带动观众一起歌唱的表演，都得到了认可！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"97db8852eeed59f2046de1d235d3da863e16c71a1af77647e85fca7907224753","ja":"おめでとう！　恵美ちゃんのパフォーマンス、\nと～っても楽しかったもんね♪","zh":"恭喜！惠美的表演，\n真的特别开心呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"9b1548b5d72f2236129949cde243f0de8fe5828648dfed3ff50519d15529ab29","ja":"たしかに、『カラオケっぽさ』だと、恵美が一番か。","zh":"确实，说到“卡拉OK感”，惠美是第一吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"26dee5943e102e8a59f8ee93b8b44be497f802a99073399df1e5a21700fcafd9","ja":"はい！　みなさんのパフォーマンスは\n全部素敵でしたが、納得の結果です！","zh":"是的！大家的表演\n都很精彩，是个令人满意的结果！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"33c53b6bfd501bef01cf5ebd1537a8969a421700428f7bd9900314384f6146d5","ja":"それにしても、同じ曲でも、\nこんなに変わるものなのね。とっても楽しかったわ。","zh":"不过，同一首歌也能变得这么不一样呢。\n真的很开心。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"0489e88dc51a2b7528cecc27819f3256fc77693e72c202a94c54c0d31274fbcb","ja":"「それでは、最後にもう一度、\n優勝した所さんに歌ってもらいましょう！」","zh":"「那么最后，请获胜的所小姐\n再为我们唱一次吧！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"f1c0d4e0dad05f91ceb9112f02c64e04d17e5c6985085b35c076a1c6af30c77b","ja":"えっ、もう一度？　それじゃあ今度は、\nみんなで歌っちゃおっ！　いくよ～……。","zh":"咦，还要再来一次？那这次就\n大家一起唱吧！要开始咯～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"eeb0e8aadb2df26506bf6fb76af19f50152ecbf7c2730edfada4032f397938a4","ja":"ミュージック、スタート♪","zh":"音乐，开始♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
